<title>TANZANIA: Tanzanian shilling up on dollar, down on pound.</title>
<headline>Tanzanian shilling up on dollar, down on pound.</headline>
<dateline>DAR ES SALAAM 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tanzanian shilling gained slightly on the dollar but fell against the pound sterling, the central Bank of Tanzania (BoT) said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The shilling was at a commercial mean rate of 619.7301 to the dollar, compared with Monday's 619.8687. Against the pound, the shilling was at 984.9402, down from 984.6646.</p>
</text>
